        (TM.teT Dp (C.subT Dp GSA (C.subT GSA GAS PSA ex) rho) (C.subT Dp GAS PSA tau1) (C.subT Dp GA P L.lpt) (C.subt Dp GSA (C.subT GSA GAS PSA ex) (C.subt GSA GAS PSA m ex) rho) (C.subt Dp GAS PSA m tau1) rhs
